    "id": "3410174836",
    "isSimulated": false,
    "title": "Girl Walking on a Rice Field 4K (Song: WMD Ficus)",
    "description": "🛑IMPORTANT:\r\nMy previous PC, which I used to make this wallpaper, was so old the wallpaper editor didn't work properly on the new version. the wallpaper was designed to work with version 2.4, that can be accessed through \"windows_7_support - Windows 7 support\" beta.\r\n**It does work** with the non-beta, more recent versions, but during version 2.5, the weather modes weren't covering the screen properly, and since version 2.6, the weather modes fully stopped working from my experience.\r\nIf that's the case for you and you want the wallpaper to work as I intended, then do these steps:\r\n- Turn off Wallpaper Engine completely.\r\n- Right click Wallpaper Engine in Steam and click on Properties.\r\n- On the left-hand side, click on the tab called BETAS.\r\n- Select the \"windows_7_support - Windows 7 support\" branch in the drop-down selection at the top and close the window.\r\n- Steam should immediately start downloading an update. After it has been downloaded, launch Wallpaper Engine through Steam to install the beta update.\r\nOther wallpapers might not work with this beta so switch back to the normal version if anything. I'm sorry for the inconvenience.\r\n\r\n🎊UPDATE 08/06/2025:\r\nI got a new, modern pc. so a version compatible with 2.6 is underway! 🥳 Stay tuned.\r\n\r\nThis wallpaper has:\r\n- Clear, Rain, Snow, Rainstorm, Fireflies and Sakura weather modes\r\n- Sunny, Cloudy, Twilight and Night themes\r\n- Cursor ripple interaction with water (optional)\r\n- three styles of clocks\r\n- Two types of audio visualizer\r\n- Outfits for the character\r\n- Never ending customization!\r\nFully optimized for performance on low end PCs + 4K resolution\r\n\r\nI still plan to improve its performance and add even more features for the best experience! If you find a bug, is suffering performance issues or want some new feature let me know in the comments! I appreciate your collaboration.\r\n\r\nSong: https://youtu.be/QIRACOIiEs8\r\nOriginal artwork: https://www.pixiv.net/en/artworks/11557316 (the original image's resolution is too low, so I scaled it up.)",
